dsh-scholar-suite README · 安全声明(供安装前审查)：- **插件本体**:零联网、零遥测、无安装期脚本(package.json 无 lifecycle scripts)、不读凭据;
- **捆绑技能的联网行为(如实声明)**:
  - 纯本地运行:academic-figures、humanize-ai-text、paper-rewriter;
  - 按功能会访问外部服务:pubmed-verifier / cite-holmes / doc-holmes(NCBI E-utilities、期刊与 DOI 解析服务)、paper-polisher(对照报告生成,可选外部排版服务)、cn-med-oa(公众号平台接口)——是否联网由对应技能的功能触发,细则见各自 SKILL.md;
- **写盘范围**:仅当前工作目录(报告/核验产物);
- **子进程**:技能脚本按各自文档调用本机 Python 3.8+(标准库优先,个别可选依赖见技能文档)。

dsh-scholar-suite README · Security declaration (for pre-install review)：- **Plugin itself**: zero telemetry, no lifecycle scripts, no credential access;
- **Bundled skills' network behavior**: academic-figures / humanize-ai-text / paper-rewriter run fully local; pubmed-verifier / cite-holmes / doc-holmes may query NCBI E-utilities and DOI resolution services; paper-polisher may use optional external layout services; cn-med-oa talks to the WeChat official-account platform — all triggered only by the corresponding skill's function, details in each SKILL.md;
- **Disk writes**: current working directory only (reports / verification artifacts).
